>	How do I get nethack to list my characters abilities before I die?

>bsl

The most reliable way is to quaff a potion of enlightenment.  That is
precisely what those potions are for.  Occasionally, drinking from a
fountain will have the same effect.  The game usually tells you when
you gain an ability, so you should just be able to figure it out by
keeping careful track.

...or you could go into eX-plore mode.  That allows you to use the 'X'
command to know your intrinsics.  It also gives you a few other
abilities (like immortality), at the expense of not appearing on the
high score list.

